e and renames it over the log so a crash mid-trim keeps the old log.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md\", \"pattern\": \"writes them only when\"}"},"time":{"start":1794564259312,"end":1794564261928}}}}
