{"type":"text","timestamp":1794564301688,"sessionID":"ses_e2ba44aa3ffeaCSqLtdsNQ8wes","part":{"id":"prt_1d45e1dcf002g7Fd3Td9ggkeb8","sessionID":"ses_e2ba44aa3ffeaCSqLtdsNQ8wes","messageID":"msg_1d45dfec000124wFADbpXKULdl","type":"text","text":"Trigger index: clean no-hit. REPO RULES loaded (`evidence-and-proof.md`; `communication.md`/`communication-handoff.md` for the close-out). sk-doc router: no leaf intent fires for a one-sentence correction to an existing architecture paragraph, so the task's frozen wording governs.","time":{"start":1794564300239,"end":1794564301688}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794564301905,"sessionID":"ses_e2ba44aa3ffeaCSqLtdsNQ8wes","part":{"partID":"prt_1d45e20900017gAgAOkGEi2Bjs","sessionID":"ses_e2ba44aa3ffeaCSqLtdsNQ8wes","messageID":"msg_1d45dfec000124wFADbpXKULdl","type":"tool","id":"call_af8a152f1a0f4039b8dd01f0","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md","oldString":"The code writes them only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set.","newString":"Each hook run writes a health record with no prompt, skill label or error text, and `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` adds the skill label and the error text."},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md\n@@ -146,9 +146,9 @@\n ## 6. ENFORCEMENT AND VERIFICATION\n \n Validation runs at two layers.\n \n-**Release validation.** `advisor_validate` runs the regression suite and reports threshold semantics (aggregate vs runtime) plus a prompt-safe `telemetry.outcomes.totals` block. Hook diagnostics persist to bounded JSONL sinks so `advisor_validate` can read them back across processes. Records carry the runtime that served the turn, the bytes delivered (`emittedBytes`) and whether the directives were suppressed (`directivesSuppressed`). The code writes them only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. The bounded trim writes a temp file and renames it over the log so a crash mid-trim keeps the old log.\n+**Release validation.** `advisor_validate` runs the regression suite and reports threshold semantics (aggregate vs runtime) plus a prompt-safe `telemetry.outcomes.totals` block. Hook diagnostics persist to bounded JSONL sinks so `advisor_validate` can read them back across processes. Records carry the runtime that served the turn, the bytes delivered (`emittedBytes`) and whether the directives were suppressed (`directivesSuppressed`). Each hook run writes a health record with no prompt, skill label or error text, and `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` adds the skill label and the error text. The bounded trim writes a temp file and renames it over the log so a crash mid-trim keeps the old log.\n \n **Test surfaces.** Default `npm test` runs unit and integration suites under `runtime/tests/`. Scorer benchmarks live under `runtime/bench/`. Operator playbook scenarios live in `manual-testing-playbook/`.\n \n ---\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md\",\"oldString\":\"The code writes them only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set.\",\"newString\":\"Each hook run writes a health record with no prompt, skill label or error text, and `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` adds the skill label and the error text.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794564300944,"end":1794564301905}}}}
